1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,249
You. Office hands. Show me.

2
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:05,360
Abby. Come here. Like, right now.

3
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:10,009
That's a guy in a hoodie. From the
side.

4
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:12,598
Same ears, though.

5
00:00:12,718 --> 00:00:14,469
Half of Chicago has ears.

6
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:16,773
<i>Don't touch your ear. Don't—</i>

7
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:22,099
Lumen's founder. Eating our fries.

8
00:00:22,219 --> 00:00:23,392
<i>…Same ears, though.</i>

9
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:29,684
<i>Thirty-four bucks. Lupe yells for
free.</i>

10
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:32,582
<i>Nine pans. Never opened one.</i>

11
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:36,713
¡Mija! Look at you! And who's this?
Flaco. Too skinny. Sit.

12
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:41,099
Half my students find me on Groupon
now.

13
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:48,758
Look at these hands. Soft. Office
hands.

14
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,545
Too much masa. It all falls apart.

15
00:00:51,665 --> 00:00:53,252
Sorry— I'll fix it.

16
00:00:53,372 --> 00:00:55,777
Don't fix. Do again.

17
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:59,183
<i>Two hundred jobs. One signature.</i>

18
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:02,919
She's been yelling at me since I was
six.

19
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:06,678
<i>Soft hands. But he looks at her like I
looked at Rogelio.</i>

20
00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:11,311
Fold. Tuck. Don't strangle it.

21
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:15,578
My mom took this class. Before her
stand on 18th.

22
00:01:15,698 --> 00:01:18,285
What made her do it?

23
00:01:18,900 --> 00:01:24,407
Honestly? Broke, bored, and it was
twenty bucks. Fed the whole block for
years off it.

24
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:32,389
I've never made anything. Like… with
my hands.

25
00:01:32,900 --> 00:01:36,632
<i>Her whole world is in this room. And
it's in my bag.</i>

26
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:40,883
Well. You made this. It's hideous.

27
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:44,051
It's so hideous.

28
00:01:44,171 --> 00:01:44,970
I love it.

29
00:01:45,650 --> 00:01:48,160
<i>'I love it.' Very chill, Reyes.</i>

30
00:01:48,650 --> 00:01:51,732
Aguas frescas! For everyone. On me.

31
00:01:51,852 --> 00:01:53,693
¡Eso!

32
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:58,108
<i>No. No no no.</i>

33
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:01,179
Fraud desk, calling for Mr. Cole.

34
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:06,601
Mr. Cole, did you authorize thirty-
eight dollars at Masa Mía?

35
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:09,477
…Who's Mr. Cole?
